{"name": "Cloudpaws", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/1351af6024bd465b4c84ce842e0be0b9.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/1351af6024bd465b4c84ce842e0be0b9.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/1351af6024bd465b4c84ce842e0be0b9.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728\u00a0<strong>A cozy trading adventure above the clouds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High above the clouds lies the Cloud Archipelago a newly discovered chain of floating islands where adorable animal folk are building a peaceful new life in the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/f18e1fd30d38a37c10049c8450206110.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\ude3b Travel</strong> between colorful islands filled with cozy markets and curious locals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every stop is a new opportunity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build reliable trade routes across the skies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/3fb443248bd0d3845ddcae559920cccb.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/3fb443248bd0d3845ddcae559920cccb.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/3fb443248bd0d3845ddcae559920cccb.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/db418526c80293dd27c2cf595554c827.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Between trade runs slow down and enjoy island life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow</strong> fresh vegetables on small island farms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fish</strong> in peaceful lakes and floating waters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep your shop stocked</strong> with wholesome goods and handmade treats so customers are always happy to return</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/7f308236f74e7f8e8e8df9c715da9006.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/7f308236f74e7f8e8e8df9c715da9006.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/7f308236f74e7f8e8e8df9c715da9006.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/9e4f63ba9da0bb300ce05f55c6b910d2.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26c5 Turn a humble airship into a beloved flying shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand</strong> cargo space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improve</strong> speed and range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn upgrades through quests and exploration then personalize your airship with new balloons colors and charming decorations to make it truly yours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/181cce57c1d79e40cd3b88adb90eb463.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/181cce57c1d79e40cd3b88adb90eb463.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/181cce57c1d79e40cd3b88adb90eb463.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"239\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/6e1487daa55712d625b3b6207a0e7027.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover</strong> the many regions of the Cloudpaws Island from lush forests to snowy mountain peaks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each region offers unique residents resources and trading opportunities Navigate changing weather uncover hidden routes and slowly expand your world map at your own pace</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/f50073bc242ab143d82801db20750183.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/f50073bc242ab143d82801db20750183.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/f50073bc242ab143d82801db20750183.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"239\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/4dc5ba2111af25f2ebdc67d03346e750.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf40 Meet</strong> memorable animal characters each with their own routines dreams and worries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the mystery of the floating islands through kindness curiosity and exploration There is no pressure and no rush</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/bd1342e5e648978e9d3d50a0089d8ede.poster.avif?t=1781542296\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/bd1342e5e648978e9d3d50a0089d8ede.webm?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/bd1342e5e648978e9d3d50a0089d8ede.mp4?t=1781542296\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc08The\u00a0Cloud</strong> <strong> Archipelago is waiting</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519660/extras/3aad66970b9829740bc28969be2143bf.pos